    },
    {
      "post_id": "553127848656257024",
      "text": "@MariaLaoise you ask for maturity then behave like a child. I thought you didn't have time for a discussion on free speech?",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 09:55:30 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5312759563905024e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553121487973277696",
      "text": "@janetravers I am open to interaction but in order for interaction to be meaningful and fruitful a certain amount of mutual respect ...",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 09:30:13 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.531207224037294e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553121141574094848",
      "text": "@SikanasGiorgos -&gt; φιλοναζί ενώ όταν σκιτσογραφείς μουσουλμάνους σε καλύπτει η ελευθερία του λόγου. Δείχνει κάτι άλλο; Και μου μίλησες για-&gt;",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 09:28:51 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.531208213138186e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553120722403729409",
      "text": "@MariaLaoise ...you wish to use that as an excuse not to engage with me, that's YOUR prerogative.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 09:27:11 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.531203145202401e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553127122953584640",
      "text": "@janetravers The discussion was about free speech. Let's stick to that.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 09:52:37 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5312674851968205e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553124309984874496",
      "text": "@MariaLaoise as you said yourself, my conversation with you was perfectly respectful. Why are you so upset that I liked someone's tweet?",
